sh throughout. I hope you are absolutely buggin' about these changes like I am.Cheers!Lew","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T11:40:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296653","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4639740-1836506165568063","game_id":"steam-4639740","kind":"announcement","title":"Gnat Pack Demo Is Here!","summary":"Me right now.... What a journey this has been so far. I'm so proud to announce that the Gnat Pack Demo is live. The demo is a condensed version of the early game, giving you roughly 20-25 minutes of playtime and a solid taste of the full experience. What's in the demo? Glad you asked imaginary conversation friend. It shows the full play loop of eat stuff, upgrade stuff, unlock more stuff. Also Bees! Little cuties! If you enjoy the demo wish list the full game and leave a review. It helps a solo ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T13:49:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568063","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4639740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:57Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:56Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4639740":"2026-10-26T13:15:57Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4639740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:56Z"},"4876470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:15:57Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"